{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103100138265-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103110225\"/><p>運輸署今日（11月3日）上午約8時20分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。署方已責成營運商從速跟進修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。</p><p>東網記者到油麻地長樂街查看，見有一半泊車咪錶位顯示OUT OF ORDER(故障)。而在大埔大順街的泊車咪錶位則似乎運作正常，有部分顯示為「逾時EXPIRED」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:52.262290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:51.822752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:51.822752+00:00","content_hash":"65407d9142fde2300a7b136a0cc867c4bdc790d9bbce5785b3d15bcc397a2a7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}